      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Unable to reproduce.\n\n```\n\nFailed to configure URL resolver: Cysharp.Threading.Tasks.UnityWebRequestException\n\n```\n\n```\n\n2026.03.07 15:41:53 Debug      -  [String Download] A web request exception occurred while loading string from URL 'https://gist.githubusercontent.com/Mwr247/a80c1f9060fc4fd46a8f00d589c47c5a/raw/pasavtrdb.txt'. Exception: \n\n2026.03.07 15:41:53 Debug      -  [PAS] Data load error\n\n```\n\nProbably a DNS resolution error (gist.githubusercontent.com is IPv4-only, no AAAA records for IPv6-only networks) and @{69ac8ce395d05cb74013cdf1|full_name}'s connection issues are not limited to VRChat in this one.\n\nFor isolated issues or customer support visit https://help.vrchat.com/",
