      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The IPv6-only network theory would also explain why api.vrchat.cloud requests are succeeding (dual stack host), but gist.githubusercontent.com (IPv4-only) are not. @{69ac8ce395d05cb74013cdf1|full_name} also says to be using Cloudflare (implied Cloudflare WARP), which is related to another Canny issue worked around by disabling IPv6 tunneling through WARP: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/workaround-found-cloudflare-warp-blocks-login-and-causes-error-since-feb-27-2026",
