  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Open VRChat 2. Log in 3. Open home world 4. Try to load different favorited avatars, but end up wearing the error avatar\n\nI've been having this problem for a long time, despite how many times I've restarted my PC and completely reinstalling VRChat. I do use Cloudflare, but I had it turned off when I made the log attached here. The results seem to be the same regardless of what I do. :(\n\nI use PCVR, but one day, I was using only my Quest 2 and everything seemed to work perfectly, so this issue is only on my computer. It is a Windows 10 version and has it's NVIDIA driver up to date.",
